{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d5d99854-082a-8e74-9f48-7b1f493d26af",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T12:34:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:32:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. My name is David Hazard. I need to get a marriage license. What do I have to bring?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:32:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Hazard. Both people getting married need to come in together, in person, to the clerk's office at City Hall. Do you have a partner who can come with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:32:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, she will come with me. She is right here. [pause] Ela pergunta si nu ta precisa di papel di divorsu. [pause] Sorry, I was asking her something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:32:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Is either of you divorced, or has either of you been married before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:32:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Me, no. Her, yes, one time. A long time ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Then she should bring the date and place the divorce was finalized, and it helps to have the paperwork if she has it. Just so we have the information right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the date and the place. And what ID do we bring? Is the driver license good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a valid driver's license works. A passport or a state ID card is fine too. It needs to be a photo ID, and it should be current, not expired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Current, not expired. Mine is good until next year. Hers I have to check. [pause] Ê, odja si bu karta inda ta valid. [pause] She says it's okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And you'll want to know our hours. We're open weekdays, and you can walk in. Don't come too close to closing, so we have time to finish everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:33:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I can come tomorrow, in the morning. Tonight I am busy, I run a fantasy football league and tonight is the draft. So tomorrow is better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sounds like you have a big night. Tomorrow morning works. Come to the clerk's office, bring both IDs, and the divorce information for your fiancée."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Two IDs, divorce date and place. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the main thing. If you want, I can take your number in case something changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It is four oh one, five five five, oh one seven one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four oh one, five five five, oh one seven one. We'll see you tomorrow, Mr. Hazard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:34:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
